\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Schematic of the pipeline (diagram only; contains no data). The scene is captured exactly, admitted as a complete finite-state graph and evaluated as a coherent linear map followed by quadratic detection. Training updates 16 mirror-pair translations that are written back to the scene as quantised native coordinates. Certificates enclose observed outputs and decisions; the separate wave reference tests in which regime the path model itself is valid.}}{3}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
