\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces WAVE-C1 with the same continuous device at every resolution. (a) Modal output powers of the reference solver (markers) and of the path models M0 (dashed) and M1 (solid) over 21 exact phases. (b) Maximum error over ports: M0 exceeds the 0.02 budget at most phases, M1 stays below 0.0041; triangles show the archived FDTD powers against the reference with the FDTD-calibrated splitter. (c) Two-MZI cascade over 63 configurations; the 21 configurations with stage-1 path difference $\lambda /2$ carry no light into stage 2 and test nothing.}}{9}{figure.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
